title: "Exact Metamer Mismatch Body Computation by Zonotope Tiling"
abstract: "MATLAB, CUDA and Slurm code that computes exact metamer mismatch bodies for a discretized spectral problem by tiling the six-dimensional double object-color solid and slicing it at a target color."
type: software
